  vendorName: Inventor Ivan
  offerText: Your grandfather's heavy, old blueprints are taking up half your closet.
    Pay my disposal fee, and I will haul them to the incinerator for you.
  acceptResultText: You pay Ivan to burn the heavy blueprints. Your closet feels
    wonderfully spacious again.
  rejectResultText: You keep the dusty blueprints, annoyed as you trip over the heavy
    rolls of paper in your room.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: A wealthy industrialist discovers your grandfather's blueprints.
    He buys the patent rights directly from you for a fantastic amount of cash!
